    "created_at": "2020-08-01T01:07:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-01T01:07:29Z",
    "body": "I think requestDevice is still correct since the chooser only allows you to select one physical device. The multiple HIDDevice objects represent multiple HID interfaces on the same physical device. getDevices returns all connected devices which may include multiple physical devices.\r\n\r\nHowever, changing to requestDevices is probably still a good idea since we may want to support multiselect in the chooser.",
