    "created_at": "2020-08-10T12:25:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-10T12:25:24Z",
    "body": "Shall we use `interfaces` instead of `devices` then?\r\n```diff\r\n- navigator.hid.requestDevices()\r\n+ navigator.hid.requestInterfaces()\r\n```\r\n```diff\r\n- navigator.hid.getDevices()\r\n+ navigator.hid.getInterfaces()\r\n```",
